    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with GDPR (personal data protection), we have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register. we data processing agreements (DPAs) are aligned with GDPR (personal data protection) Article 28. we ensure data minimization and configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For confidentiality and security, we implement Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and audit logging of access and system outputs. we secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider equivalent to CREST level." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we existing hosting partnership with OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification, we can ensure that data is hosted within the EU, supporting sovereign hosting of confidential data. hosted prevents any transfer of data outside the EU, complying with the client's requirements. we familiarity with professional secrecy and anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT) ensures we understand the importance of maintaining confidentiality and adhering to professional secrecy and anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT). we also comply with statutory audit principles, including auditor independence and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing security controls and compliance framework, we can meet the client's demands for strict confidentiality, professional secrecy, reliability of figures, and compliance with GDPR (personal data protection), anti-money laundering regulations, and legal retention obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires that the solution comply with applicable laws and regulations, including GDPR, anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT), and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The provider must guarantee a complete audit trail and explainability, and the solution must respect auditor's independence and the separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these requirements, what are the key legal risks that we need to flag, and how can we demonstrate compliance with regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent for we, the Legal Agent for Faber IA confirm that we is aware of the importance of complying with applicable laws and regulations, including GDPR, anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT), and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents.  we maintain up-to-date social and fiscal obligations, and we have administrative attestations available to demonstrate maintain. we experience in contractual arrangements includes familiarity with professional secrecy expectations from clients bound by such obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, the Legal Agent for Faber IA flag the following key legal risks:  1) non-compliance with GDPR, which could result in significant fines;  2) failure to adhere to anti-money laundering regulations (LCB-FT), potentially leading to reputational damage and penalties; and  3) inadequate retention and archival of accounting documents, which may lead to audit issues or regulatory action." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate compliance with these regulatory requirements, we will:  1) ensure we platform's data protection practices align with GDPR expectations, including data sovereignty, encryption, and access controls; 2) implement measures to prevent money laundering, in line with LCB-FT regulations; and 3) establish a document management system that adheres to legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents. we will also provide a complete audit trail and explainability for we solution, ensuring transparency and accountability." ;
