    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at we, I can assure that we have already taken steps towards reducing we environmental footprint. we have conducted a bilan carbone, which means we have assessed we carbon footprint, and we have published a trajectory to reduce we carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year." ;
