    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of timelines, our propose the following milestones: * Week 1-4: the Framing phase, which is expected to last around 2-4 weeks, depending on the complexity of the project and the client's availability * Week 5-10: Design phase * Week 11-22: the Pilot phase, which is expected to last around 8-12 weeks * Week 23-38: the Generalisation phase, which will last around 12-16 weeks * After week 38: Run phase Regarding resource allocation, our will assign a dedicated team to the project, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead. a dedicated team will work closely with The client to ensure that the solution meets The client requirements and provide ongoing support during the Run phase, which is expected to last for an extended period. our available capacity includes a dedicated team of 7 people, with confirmed availability to onboard an engagement of this size within the proposed timeline. our also have additional resources for change management and training, which our can allocate as needed to support The client during the deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, the following project plan is designed to meet The client requirements for a progressive deployment with a pilot phase, while also ensuring that the solution is delivered on time, within budget, and to the required quality standards." ;
